  "remarks": "\nVladimir Vladimirovich VLADIMIROV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because VLADIMIROV is a regional governor. Specifically, VLADIMIROV is Governor of Stavropol Territory.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
